detail/id/4249/) [Little](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1337/)\n\n[Oswegatchi (Owbow to Elmdale)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1366/) [Oswegatchi East Branch Sect. 1](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1368/)\n\n[Oswegatchi East Branch Sect. 2](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1369/) [Oswegatchi East Branch Sect. 3](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/5501/)\n\n[Oswegatchi East Branch Sect. 4](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1367/)[Oswegatchi Middle Branch Sect. 1](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1370/)\n\n[Oswegatchi Middle Branch Sect. 2](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1371/) [Oswegatchi Middle Branch Sect. 4 (Sluice Falls)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/5456/)\n\n[Oswegatchi West Branch (Bisha to Jerden)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1373/) [Oswegatchi West Branch (Fullerville to Oswegatchi)](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1372/)\n\n[Sawyer Creek](https://www.americanwhitewater.org/content/River/detail/id/1417/)\n\n**[Google Map of New York Whitewater](https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=zjdnDE8H0TLg.kJnMWGapL4xk)**\n\n**[New York Whitewater Paddlers Facebook Group](https://www.facebook.com/groups/108070075877312/)**","averageGradient":null,"maxGradient":null,"length":"15.4","correlations":[{"reachID":"1367","isPrimary":true,"correlationDetails":{"metric":"cfs","belowRecommendedRangeComment":"As per Squires","lowRunnableRangeComment":"As per Squires","mediumRunnableRangeComment":"Ideal as per Squires","highRunnableRangeComment":null,"aboveRecommendedRangeComment":null,"lowRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"highRunnableAdjustedDifficulty":null,"beginLowRunnable":"450","beginMediumRunnable":"800","beginHighRunnable":"1100","endHighRunnable":"1500"},"gaugeInfo":{"name"